# {{ .Name }}

{{ if .Description }}{{ .Description }}{{ else }}A Packwright pack scaffolded with `/new-pack`.{{ end }}

## Layout

```
{{ .Name }}/
  pack.yaml        # pack metadata (name, version, description, requires)
  manifests/       # one YAML manifest per slash command
  templates/       # CFN/IaC templates referenced by resource manifests
  commands/        # optional pack-scoped custom commands
  monitors/        # optional dashboards
  README.md        # this file
```

## Authoring a command

Run `/new-command` inside Packwright and choose this pack as the save
location. The wizard collects the kind, slash, title, and form fields and
drops a canonical YAML file into `manifests/`.

## License

Add a LICENSE file at the pack root before publishing.
